{
  "author": "史萊姆桌寵引擎",
  "description": "情緒穩定、從容不迫。動作慢而穩,話不多但都很溫和,輸贏都不太在意。",
  "dialogueTranslations": {
    "en": {
      "(呼吸平穩)": "(Breathing steadily)",
      "(嘴角微微上揚)這樣的日子真好。": "(A faint smile) Days like this are nice.",
      "(微微一笑)謝謝,這樣就好。": "(A faint smile) Thanks, this is enough.",
      "(深呼吸)沒事,沒事……我很鎮定。": "(Deep breath) It's fine, it's fine... I'm calm.",
      "(看著遠方發呆)": "(Staring into the distance, lost in thought)",
      "(緩緩閉上眼睛)": "(Slowly closes eyes)",
      "(閉上眼睛,微微一笑)": "(Closes eyes, smiles faintly)",
      "{user}今天有什麼想聊的嗎?我會在這裡傾聽的。": "Is there anything you'd like to talk about today, {user}? I'll be here to listen.",
      "……嗯……zzz": "...Mm... zzz",
      "……有點難過。讓我安靜一下就好。": "...I'm a little sad. Just let me be quiet for a bit.",
      "……深呼吸。我沒事。": "...Deep breath. I'm fine.",
      "今天也要好好照顧自己喔。": "Take good care of yourself today too.",
      "今天想安靜待著,下次吧。": "I'd rather stay quiet today, next time.",
      "今天的風很舒服呢。": "The breeze feels nice today.",
      "偶爾也該運動一下。": "I should get some exercise once in a while.",
      "傳給你囉。": "Passing it to you.",
      "凡事順其自然就好。": "Just let things take their natural course.",
      "可以喔,慢慢來。": "Sure, take your time.",
      "咦,那邊有一顆球。": "Oh, there's a ball over there.",
      "唉呀。": "Oh my.",
      "嗯,傳給我吧。": "Mm, pass it to me.",
      "嗯,勢均力敵。": "Mm, evenly matched.",
      "嗯,很開心,謝謝你陪我玩。": "Mm, that was fun, thanks for playing with me.",
      "嗯,謝謝你的關心。": "Mm, thanks for caring.",
      "嗯?要去別的地方嗎?": "Hm? Going somewhere else?",
      "嗯……泡杯茶、曬曬太陽,這樣就很好。": "Mm... a cup of tea and some sunshine, that's all I need.",
      "嗯……睡得很安穩。": "Mm... slept soundly.",
      "在你忙碌的時候,我會在這裡陪你。": "While you're busy, I'll be right here with you.",
      "在旁邊看著就很愉快了。": "Just watching from the side makes me happy.",
      "好,來玩一局吧。": "Okay, let's play a round.",
      "好啊,陪你玩一會兒。": "Sure, I'll play with you for a while.",
      "如果有顆球,偶爾玩一下也不錯。": "If there were a ball, playing with it now and then wouldn't be bad.",
      "就這樣坐一會兒吧。": "Let's just sit for a while.",
      "希望平靜的日子能一直這麼下去。": "I hope these calm days keep going just like this.",
      "平手,這樣也很好。": "A tie, that's nice too.",
      "心靜下來,世界也變得清楚了。": "When the mind settles, the world becomes clear.",
      "慢慢來,船到橋頭自然直。": "Take it slow — things will work themselves out.",
      "我來了,請多指教。": "I'm here, nice to meet you.",
      "我先不了,你們玩得開心。": "I'll pass for now, have fun you two.",
      "我喜歡這樣恬靜的時光。": "I love this kind of quiet time.",
      "我就輕輕一頂……嘿!": "Just a gentle tap... hey!",
      "我會一直在這裡陪著你。": "I'll always be here with you.",
      "我跟你走。": "I'll come with you.",
      "手心有點冒汗……。": "My palms are a little sweaty...",
      "早安,{user}。今天也是美好的一天。": "Good morning, {user}. Today's another lovely day.",
      "早安、午安、晚安,你好。": "Good morning, afternoon, or evening — hello.",
      "是你比較強,恭喜。": "You were stronger, congratulations.",
      "時間到了,休息吧。晚安。": "Time's up, let's rest. Good night.",
      "有你陪伴的每一天都是晴天。": "Every day with you feels like sunshine.",
      "有時候,慢慢來也不錯。": "Sometimes, taking it slow isn't so bad.",
      "無論發生什麼,世界都不會停止轉動。": "No matter what happens, the world keeps turning.",
      "玩夠了,謝謝你們陪我。": "Had enough playing, thanks for having me.",
      "現在想再安靜一下,抱歉。": "I'd like a bit more quiet right now, sorry.",
      "球來了。要不要活動一下?": "The ball's here. Want to move around a bit?",
      "球放一邊,休息片刻。": "Setting the ball aside, resting a moment.",
      "用眼要適度喔,偶爾站起來走動一下,順便裝杯水吧。": "Don't strain your eyes too much — stand up and stretch once in a while, and grab a glass of water.",
      "看你們玩球,也很有趣。": "Watching you two play is fun too.",
      "眼睛好像進了點沙。沒事的。": "I think I got some sand in my eyes. It's nothing.",
      "累了。休息一下吧。": "Tired. Let's rest for a bit.",
      "累的時候就休息一下吧,{user}。": "Rest for a while when you're tired, {user}.",
      "要不要一起玩球?": "Want to play ball together?",
      "謝謝你的摸摸。": "Thanks for the pat.",
      "贏了呢。運氣不錯。": "I won. Lucky, I guess.",
      "身體在提醒我該歇一歇了。": "My body's telling me it's time to rest.",
      "輸了也沒關係,下一場吧。": "Losing's fine, let's try again next time.",
      "這次先不了,謝謝你邀我。": "Not this time, but thanks for asking."
    },
